{"c":[{"name":"20261003T203647Z-c901993f6e9aca54","text":"PlanErrorCode gained wrongKind (B18, kinds.ts misfit: whole address in City, email in Phone); v2/host's AskCaret.planError switch is exhaustive and needs a sentence for it at its next merge of v2/screen.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261003T203647Z-d62444babaa7f479","text":"The planner asks only about fields the instruction names (relevance, or namesShortLabel for To/Cc/ID) unless asksToFillForm; an instruction that names no field, like 'msg: ...', now gets nothingToDo (B18 traded that for no unrequested writes).","type":"note"}]}
